WEBVTT

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:28.310
So far, I have gathered 50 Numbers.

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:35.260
I only need 50 of the total 100 scattered Numbers
 necessary to revive my memories.

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:03.420
Durbe.

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:05.290
Misael?

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:09.250
It's become clear that we'll get nowhere with Gilag and Alit.

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:13.570
Yeah. I'm left with no other choice but to let you go.

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:15.220
That was my intention from the start.

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:17.680
Take these with you.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:19.250
These are...?

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.140
Barian Sphere Cubes.

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:26.140
Though temporary, you can create a Sphere Field with these.

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:29.220
I see. As long as we're inside the Sphere Field,

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:34.400
even if we are in the human world,
 we can fight using our Barian powers.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:38.860
Right. With this, it saves us the effort
 of controlling people through brainwashing.

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:45.080
By directly Dueling Yuma Tsukumo,
 we can recover the Numbers with our own hands.

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:50.080
I thought we would not have to use them,
 but as it stands, it's unavoidable now.

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:53.170
One of these three is for you.

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:56.400
Pass the others onto Gilag and Alit.

00:01:57.170 --> 00:02:01.050
I guess we can say this is their last chance, right?

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:03.110
That's what it means.

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:05.180
So, I am counting on you, Misael.

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:09.520
You have to defeat Yuma Tsukumo once and for all 
and recover the Numbers.

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.540
All for the Barian World.

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:16.940
I'm counting on you, Misael.

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:30.940
You still exhaust me, as usual.

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:38.460
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:44.430
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:47.140
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:59.490
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:02.570
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:07.080
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.450
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:12.670
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:17.210
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:19.340
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:22.050
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:24.510
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:27.560
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:30.020
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:36.060
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:38.820
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:40.280
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:44.990
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:54.040
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:14.620
"The Lone Barian Knight:
 Misael the Galaxy-Eyes Master Appears"

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:10.870
Yuma!

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:21.840
Astral!

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:35.350
Astral?!

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:44.440
Ouch...

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:49.450
A dream...? Though that dream was strangely vivid...

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:58.370
No, I can't! How can I get <i>that</i> scared because of some dream!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.330
As I am now...

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:05.380
Can I really protect Astral...?

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:20.560
Draw! Draw!

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:24.190
Draw! Draw!

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:27.990
Draw! Draw!

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:34.240
Draw!

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:39.040
I set one bear face-down and end my turn!

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.180
Can't... can't do anymore...!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.310
Gilag, how can you be so pathetic?

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:01.560
Shut up! Here I am, training together with you!

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.810
How about some appreciation...!

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:04.610
Huh?

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:05.270
What's...?

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:06.320
Huh?

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.280
Wh-What's that?

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:26.000
That's from the Barian World?

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.090
Right.

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:39.020
Sure went overboard there...

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.640
That overdone flashiness...

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:47.150
There's no mistaking... that incredible power.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:51.320
It's him. <i>That guy's</i> come here.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:07:59.330
Misael...

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.920
Barian Sphere Cube?

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:09.420
In other words, with this,
we can set up a temporary Sphere Field.

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:13.010
Thanks a bunch! Now I can fight Yuma at full force!

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:17.810
Until now, we only could use those useless humans by brainwashing them.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.930
We can finally get serious here!

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:20.600
Huh?

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.560
Well, just try the best you can.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.770
Wait, Misael! What are you up to...?

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:32.450
Tch... That guy pisses me off!

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.490
It's for the best, so I wanted to ask...

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:39.540
Is there anything wrong with Yuma-<i>kun</i>?

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:43.790
He kinda looks a bit down in the dumps today...

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.920
He's been like that since this morning.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:49.380
Astral hasn't shown himself either.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:52.630
Yup, Granny's stewed Meat and Potatoes is the best!

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.800
Is that so? Then feel free to have more.

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:58.430
Thanks for the food.

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:00.930
Oh, are you full already?

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:03.430
I don't much of an appetite.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:04.850
I see...

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:16.360
<i>Barian has been attacking continuously.</i>

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:19.910
<i>The Chaos Xyz these guys are using...</i>

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:22.580
<i>When it's Special Summoned with Barian's Force,</i>

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:26.580
<i>all the Overlay Units of my Xyz Monsters are absorbed...</i>

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:31.300
<i>Additionally, for every Overlay Unit absorbed,</i>

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.920
<i>their Attack Power goes down by 300 points.</i>

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:37.220
<i>Thanks to that, I'm at an overwhelming disadvantage here.</i>

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:41.470
<i>Something... If I don't think of a way to counter that...</i>

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:43.680
<i>If I don't, I'll...</i>

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.990
Yuma, hurry it up!

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:02.120
W-Wait for me, man!

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:10.500
Why do I have to bring this stuff to the Duel Lodge...?

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:18.260
<i>Huh? You want me to go to
 the Duel Lodge with Yuma during the holidays?</i>

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:23.060
<i>For some reason, Yuma's been really out of it lately.</i>

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:25.720
<i>He seems to be worrying about something.</i>

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:30.190
<i>I was thinking that some good fresh 
mountain air would do him some good.</i>

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:32.900
<i>I understand what you mean by that.</i>

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:35.150
<i>But why me?</i>

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:37.610
<i>Why? Because...</i>

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:41.200
<i>C'mon now!</i>

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:44.240
Geez, Granny Haru is so...!

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:02.050
Excuse us!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.180
Is anyone here?

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.980
Yamikawa-<i>san</i>!

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.650
Long time no see, Yuma.

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:17.320
I see, so Haru-<i>san</i> sent you up here with this.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.110
What the heck?

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:24.240
All that effort to bring the stuff up here 
and Old Man Rokujuro isn't even here.

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:26.120
Sorry.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:30.790
The Master went on a trip a few days ago and hasn't returned yet.

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:33.210
But it's all right. Take your time and rest here.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:50.730
<i>Am I good enough as I am?</i>

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:54.230
<i>Can I protect this guy like this?</i>

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:13.330
Yuma.

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:16.840
Something seems to be worrying you.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:23.050
You don't need to be ashamed of your
doubts and worries.

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.890
Once, I was like that too.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:27.010
Yamikawa-<i>san</i>...

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:29.890
I'm supposed to give these to you...

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:33.310
These are...

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:36.480
If you were to come in while the Master isn't here,

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.770
and something seems to be worrying you,

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:41.320
I was told to give these cards to you.

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:43.240
Old Man Rokujiro said that?

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:49.080
The Master seems to have foresight for things concerning his disciples.

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:06.010
<i>Grandpa gave me an offensive card and a defensive card.</i>

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:08.390
<i>If I use them both well,</i>

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:11.350
<i>even if the opponent comes up with a Chaos Xyz...</i>

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:14.810
What's your problem?!

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:17.650
Because you keep making such an awkward face!

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:20.110
Who cares what kind of face I have?!

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:22.990
No way! It doesn't suit you!

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:26.450
Damn! Then it's my turn now!

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:29.370
Draw! Draw!

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:35.960
Sorry for the wait.

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.120
Hey, you're so slow!

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:39.920
- How long are you going to keep me wai-
 - What's with that tone?!

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:45.130
Rio?

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:49.970
It's coming... to destroy the most important thing...

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:54.640
To destroy everything... The Dragon of Ill Omen...

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:58.980
What are you saying? Don't tell me... Barian?!

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:06.110
Geez, we're all soaking wet now!

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.820
But don't you feel a bit more cheerful now?

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:12.830
Does that mean you were worrying about me, Kotori?

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.950
It's not like I was worrying about you or anything...

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:19.960
More importantly, shouldn't we hurry up and get back?

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.040
We'll catch a cold if we-

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:23.090
Kotori!

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:26.380
So it's you?

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:29.720
This guy they call Yuma Tsukumo?

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:33.850
Y-You bastard! Why'd you do that to Kotori?!

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:37.850
Barian's Sphere Field! Expand!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.190
Wh-What the?

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:46.490
This is...?!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:05.300
What?! Just what is happening here?!

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:30.110
Just who are you?!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:32.740
My name is Misael.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:37.950
Yuma Tsukumo, I am also the last Duelist you'll ever face.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:42.580
An emergency has occurred!

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:45.420
Detecting abnormal energy at Point 753!

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:47.300
An abnormal energy?

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:48.130
Yes!

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:53.550
An energy field possibly very similar to the Sphere Field has been formed.

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:56.310
What?! Don't tell me...

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:59.770
If you're pulling a trick like this, then...

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:02.100
He's a Barian!

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:07.610
<i>Barian... In other words... If I don't defeat that guy,</i>

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.230
<i>I can't protect Astral!</i>

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:12.530
What's wrong? Getting cold feet?

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:15.120
Nonsense! No way that'd be true!

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:18.830
Yuma...

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:22.120
Then you accept this Duel, right?

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:24.750
Of course!

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.210
Let's go! The game's on!

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:32.300
Duel Disk, set!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:46.310
D-Gazer, set!

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:52.150
Duel Target: Locked on!

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:56.700
Duel!!

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:59.490
I'll go first!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:01.540
My turn! Draw!

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.290
Yuma, just what is going on here?

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:16.180
So you finally show up, Astral.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:18.470
He can see me...?

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:19.390
Astral,

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.310
That guy is a Barian!

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:21.930
What?

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:25.270
Don't worry. I'm not gonna lose this!

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:26.190
Yuma!

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:29.440
I Summon Goblindbergh!

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:34.900
When this Monster is Summoned successfully,

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:39.160
I can Special Summon one Level Four or lower Monster from my hand!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.790
I Special Summon this guy from my hand!

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:45.500
Appear, Ganbara Knight!

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.210
Here I go, Barian!

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:58.140
I Overlay the Level Four Goblindbergh and Ganbara Knight!

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:05.020
With these two Monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:07.190
Xyz Summon!

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:11.770
Appear now, Number 39!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:14.570
Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:23.120
<i>Alright! Plus, I have...</i>

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:25.910
<i>...the two cards Grandpa Rokujuro gave me.</i>

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.830
<i>This Duel.. I must not lose no matter what!</i>

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.670
<i>The opponent will Summon a Chaos Xyz for sure.</i>

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:36.550
<i>So if... If I were to lose...</i>

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:38.760
<i>Astral will...</i>

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:48.980
Gramps... No, Master, let me use the cards you gave me!

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:54.150
I equip Hope with the Equip Magic, Overlay Chain!

00:18:57.280 --> 00:19:00.610
Due to this card's effect, Hope's Overlay Units...

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:03.580
...are unaffected by the effects from the cards you activate!

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:07.450
I see...

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:12.670
That way, even if the opponent uses Barian's Force
 and plays a Chaos Xyz Monster,

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:15.090
the Overlay Units will not be taken away!

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:17.710
But how surprising...

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:21.220
For you to use Overlay Chain, which focuses on defense...

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:24.850
On the other hand, the other card, Overlay Bullet...

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:29.350
...can send all the Overlay Units of your Xyz Monster to the Graveyard

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:36.020
to inflict 500 Points of damage for
 each to your opponent is an offensive card.

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:40.990
Being you, I thought for sure that you would
 have chosen Overlay Bullet for sure.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.280
I have to be very careful in this Duel.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:46.080
I see... Not a bad tactic-

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.120
With this I end my turn!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:56.460
As if on order, you managed to Summon
 Hope during the very first turn.

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:02.130
Here I go! My turn! Draw!

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:05.300
I Special Summon this Monster!

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:08.470
Show yourself, Radius the Half-Moon Dragon!

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:20.150
This guy can be Special Summoned when there is an Xyz Monster on my opponent's field.

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:25.410
Additionally, when it was Special Summoned successfully, its level doubles!

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:30.580
Continuing, I Summon Parsec the Interstellar Dragon!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:36.920
If there is a Level Eight Monster on my field, this monster...

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:39.840
...can be Summoned without release!

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:42.550
There are two high-level Monsters...!

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:43.630
Which means...

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:50.640
I Overlay the Level Eight Radius the Half-Moon Dragon and Parsec the Interstellar Dragon!

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:57.360
With these two Monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:20:57.770 --> 00:20:59.190
Xyz Summon!

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:03.450
The roaring that pierces the universe!

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:09.080
Reflect the distant past and revive from the root of the galaxy!

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:14.210
Show yourself and guide me to victory!

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:18.670
Number 107!

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:37.440
Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:52.290
The 107th Number, you say?!

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.120
D-Don't tell me...!

00:21:57.960 --> 00:22:00.040
Don't tell me that dream...

00:22:17.850 --> 00:22:24.730
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:25.150 --> 00:22:32.410
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:40.000
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:47.170
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.880 --> 00:23:04.270
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:04.270 --> 00:23:09.070
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:09.070 --> 00:23:19.410
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:27.960
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:32.760
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:34.550 --> 00:23:39.060
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:43.770
Misael has Summoned an Over Hundred Number.

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:47.650
Facing its overwhelming power, we're pushed into a corner!

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:52.160
But in this desperate situation, that man has come piercing through the skies!

00:23:52.910 --> 00:23:54.950
Any kind of attack is useless on him!

00:23:54.950 --> 00:23:56.620
Kaito has come to the rescue!

00:23:56.870 --> 00:23:59.870
The two dragons are calling out to each other?!

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:02.330
